scoring Hessian), not an exact GLS information matrix.

The constraint projection is
\eqn{\mathbf{U} = \mathbf{I} -
  \mathbf{G}\mathbf{A}(\mathbf{A}^\top\mathbf{G}\mathbf{A})^{-1}
